@startuml
title CloudNotes -- Create Note Request Sequence
actor User
participant Browser
participant "NGINX Ingress / Frontend" as frontend
participant "Backend REST API" as backend
database PostgreSQL
participant Prometheus
participant Grafana
User -> Browser : Enter title and body
Browser -> frontend : POST /api/notes
frontend -> backend : Forward JSON request
backend -> backend : Validate input
backend -> PostgreSQL : INSERT note
PostgreSQL --> backend : New note ID
backend -> backend : Increment notes_created_total
backend --> frontend : 201 Created + JSON
frontend --> Browser : Display created note
Prometheus -> backend : GET /metrics
backend --> Prometheus : HTTP and note counters
Grafana -> Prometheus : Query request and note metrics
Prometheus --> Grafana : Time-series results
@enduml
